      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The prospectus document of武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司, regarding which the issuer, all directors, supervisors, senior management, controlling shareholders, and actual controllers commit that there are no false records, misleading statements, or material omissions, and they bear individual and joint legal liability for its truthfulness, accuracy, and completeness.&lt;SEP&gt;The IPO prospectus document of武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司.&lt;SEP&gt;The IPO prospectus document of Wuhan Xingtu Xinke Electronics Co., Ltd.&lt;SEP&gt;The IPO prospectus document of武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司, containing financial accounting information and management analysis, including main financial information after the audit report cutoff date.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-bb1465842bc243ace009be2a2aa83856-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-95299e8db16453efe532597414644b47-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5886f673610ef57d7b194eb5192beac3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-782cfc6f740dae238f3cff4d5b979f9a-chunk-000</data>
