      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The IPO prospectus document issued by武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司, containing major event reminders and risk factor sections for investors.&lt;SEP&gt;The IPO prospectus (招股意向书) of武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司, which discloses risks including accounts receivable bad debt, classified information disclosure, and increased depreciation and amortization expenses after the fundraising investment projects are implemented.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-c60bf31ac967823de21d6afc2fd6ea18-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19874ae4e3954337d5d4dccec0d1877-chunk-000</data>
