    <node id="军方">
      <data key="d0">军方</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Military customer/user whose construction plans and budget approval processes are generally lengthy; its contract signing approval process is long, and after the 2016 military reform its unit responsibilities and personnel relations adjusted frequently, further delaying planning, budget, and contract signing approval for some projects. It has clear acceptance standards for the company's widely deployed products.&lt;SEP&gt;The military customer that purchases system-level equipment through general contracting units, completes acceptance and approval processes, and has long settlement cycles.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-95299e8db16453efe532597414644b47-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5886f673610ef57d7b194eb5192beac3-chunk-000</data>
