      <data key="d0">系统集成单位</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Downstream customers to which the company sells products; when contracts stipulate the company does not bear integration, installation, or project construction duties, the company acts as product supplier delivering standardized tested products to them.</data>
